  {
   "id": "e379d5d8-7a0d-424d-aff7-a38289f6046d",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Important separation: System_Type is not interchangeable with Functional Scope, Deployment, Architecture, Licensing, Edition/Plan, Version, Module/Feature, Localization, Market, or Integration."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0766b6e8-0a9f-4a8e-9327-25b69ca603be",
   "type": "heading_1",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "4. Provenance and Evidence Rules"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6492c4c4-1c0d-4483-beba-4ea78d6671f6",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The persisted operating model requires:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "4515125e-c6fd-46be-aa7b-1e7d18b6c376",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Research_ID → Source_ID → Evidence_ID → Claim_ID → Classification_ID / Knowledge_ID → Change_ID → Cycle_ID"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9a4c4951-e721-4dd9-b3a8-1d9e1b040f73",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Keep these entities separate."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "af2b424a-f3bb-49d1-9025-970843f1b0e0",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Evidence roles already reconciled:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "55e13336-ecae-424d-8ae0-b8383c32888f",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Vendor / primary product documentation = strongest for product facts."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "018c0b96-00c4-4a7b-b730-765ba0ab85a1",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent academic/professional sources = conceptual or contextual validation."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2610f1b3-046d-48fc-aded-0184cb22d8e2",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Conversation claims = hypotheses unless independently corroborated."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c8905536-0aca-4a66-8083-13f780f49fe4",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "A source must not be used to support a stronger claim than its scope allows."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "db3de05c-2825-4125-a1b3-cf9c1987d4a7",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Thuy et al. (2026) is retained as contextual/empirical ERP implementation/integration evidence, not as formal accounting-software-vs-ERP taxonomy proof."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7ae5cb7e-707d-4c6e-8fb0-d5745a34cc0e",
   "type": "heading_1",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "5. Integrity Corrections Preserved"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a7dc38bf-5cb8-4706-9ae8-b278ae45eecc",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "A stale ASK-2 latest-cycle linkage was corrected earlier through the integrity audit."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "39b35362-feb0-4833-8e84-9869e76a14b2",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Historical Change ID 14 remains incomplete/non-verified; it was not retroactively promoted."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "93a1a0c2-7a8e-48a3-a139-bf77e564d18d",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The earlier conversational label ASC-015 was not accepted as a persisted cycle because the Change/Cycle records did not support it."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8f8e4145-d658-45f5-a7a3-ce022b9ba395",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The actual persisted sequence must be read from Notion, not inferred from numerical continuity."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9e5f62d6-6674-4abd-85bc-b8fc163d9b55",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "SUPERSEDED ≠ DELETED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "477415c9-0e64-4e99-89e8-959c6f505575",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Historical snapshots must not be rewritten as if they were current state."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "61a25f23-d732-46e1-96b9-9db87b17770e",
   "type": "heading_1",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "6. Detected Current Metadata Discrepancy"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8dcdfb66-a3cb-4c2d-b9ec-df49cccc1452",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The current ASK-4 Knowledge Asset is ACTIVE / VERIFIED, but its property Last Changed By Cycle still contains CKC-64."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a46b44f2-6617-4523-9926-67bcf86ebb7e",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The persisted Change Log and Cycle Log explicitly show:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "44c103f4-6cbb-4670-9144-f87c37eeaf44",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "CKC-73 updated/contextualized ASK-4."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1d3c2f8-544c-4d9f-8f84-b56dca896278",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "ASC-CHG-25 references Knowledge ID 4 and records that change."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2c1d9068-2100-4288-b129-1db17bce7cdb",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Therefore CKC-64 is stale as the last-change pointer for ASK-4."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2696e0da-5f89-4175-9f88-cb42299c52c4",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Required corrective action: change ASK-4 Last Changed By Cycle to CKC-73 and preserve ASC-CHG-25 as the historical verified change."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ca8250d0-f2e2-4140-890b-9558b8ae75f6",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Execution state: not applied in this run because the direct Notion update was blocked. Do not represent it as completed."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f3a6b6f5-2a06-4b83-aba6-19aee9b35fdb",
   "type": "heading_1",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "7. Conversation vs Persisted State"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "3f289474-9063-48f9-b884-a6b70d191f88",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "A. Conversation-level material"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "11628391-a0e8-476f-bf56-fb1ebf595bde",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The conversation contained classification-boundary reasoning, adversarial testing, product/edition/licensing/deployment/architecture tests, evidence-role corrections, taxonomy design decisions, and persistence/integrity requirements."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:45:00.000Z"
  },
